/9/9b/94250xstghmuiq2gu3g10bx0ulj0br3.png/80px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%85%94%E5%AD%90%E6%80%A5%E4%BA%86%E4%B9%9F%E9%94%A4%E4%BA%BA.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9b/94250xstghmuiq2gu3g10bx0ulj0br3.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%85%94%E5%AD%90%E6%80%A5%E4%BA%86%E4%B9%9F%E9%94%A4%E4%BA%BA.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/9b/94250xstghmuiq2gu3g10bx0ulj0br3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />兔子急了也锤人\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，✦拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">8</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"炸毛\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">炸毛</font></span></span>]或拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"严肃点！\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">严肃点！</font></span></span>]时，攻击时获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无视守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">无视守护</font></span></span>]标签。<br />✦处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形时，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，✦拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">8</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"炸毛\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">炸毛</font></span></span>]或拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"严肃点！\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">严肃点！</font></span></span>]时，攻击时获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无视守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">无视守护</font></span></span>]标签。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">嗷鸣！巨龙咆哮！</font></span>]释放后，使攻击范围地形格变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]。<br />✦处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形时，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>；行动结束时，回复物攻值<font color=\"#58cb48\">30%</font>的生命值。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，✦拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">8</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"炸毛\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">炸毛</font></span></span>]或拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"严肃点！\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">严肃点！</font></span></span>]时，攻击时获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无视守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">无视守护</font></span></span>]标签。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">嗷鸣！巨龙咆哮！</font></span>]释放后，使攻击范围地形格变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]，若命中<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>名及以上敌人时，自身回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">2</font>点能量。<br />✦处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形时，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，释放技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">惹我试试</font></span>]后，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"再行动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">再行动</font></span></span>]，并继承剩余移动力，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次；行动结束时，回复物攻值<font color=\"#58cb48\">30%</font>的生命值。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"覆雪之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/db/odghvivgd945bs5bdajzn9jeom0r382.png/40px-%E8%A6%86%E9%9B%AA%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/db/odghvivgd945bs5bdajzn9jeom0r382.png/60px-%E8%A6%86%E9%9B%AA%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/db/odghvivgd945bs5bdajzn9jeom0r382.png/80px-%E8%A6%86%E9%9B%AA%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：60<img alt=\"覆雪之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/db/odghvivgd945bs5bdajzn9jeom0r382.png/40px-%E8%A6%86%E9%9B%AA%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/db/odghvivgd945bs5bdajzn9jeom0r382.png/60px-%E8%A6%86%E9%9B%AA%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/db/odghvivgd945bs5bdajzn9jeom0r382.png/80px-%E8%A6%86%E9%9B%AA%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /> 20<img alt=\"勇气之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/6dleo3p17ck5tknku8e0evg4bq1vbpg.png/40px-%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/6dleo3p17ck5tknku8e0evg4bq1vbpg.png/60px-%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/6dleo3p17ck5tknku8e0evg4bq1vbpg.png/80px-%E5